# CSS

`public/css/styles.css` is the override layer on top of Arter. Do not edit minified Elementor/plugin CSS.

- Match existing Arter tokens (text `#8c8c8e`, headings `#ffffff`).
- Prefer additive rules with Arter class selectors over new global resets.
- Keep changes scoped. Do not restyle the whole theme for a one-off post.
